      <title>如何给hexo网站更换字体</title>
      <link href="/2025/11/14/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BB%99%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84hexo%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93/"/>
      <url>/2025/11/14/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%BB%99%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84hexo%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="如何给hexo网站更换字体"><a href="#如何给hexo网站更换字体" class="headerlink" title="如何给hexo网站更换字体"></a>如何给hexo网站更换字体</h1><p>首先下载你想要的字体。。。我这里以霞鹜文楷为例子</p><p>下载地址是 <a href="https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai">霞鹜文楷</a></p><p>1.首先在博客根目录的&#x2F;source里面创建一个叫font的文件夹用来放置你的字体文件</p><p>2.找到你的custom.css文件，在里面插入以下代码</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="string">@font-face</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">/*</span> <span class="string">为载入的字体取名字(随意)</span> <span class="string">*/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">font-family:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;kai&#x27;</span><span class="string">;</span>    </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">/*</span> <span class="string">字体文件地址(相对或者绝对路径都可以)</span> <span class="string">*/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">src:</span> <span class="string">url(/font/LXGWWenKaiMono-Regular.ttf);</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">/*</span> <span class="string">定义加粗样式(加粗多少)</span> <span class="string">*/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">font-weight:</span> <span class="string">normal;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">/*</span> <span class="string">定义字体样式(斜体/非斜体)</span> <span class="string">*/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">font-style:</span> <span class="string">normal;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">/*</span> <span class="string">定义显示样式</span> <span class="string">*/</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">font-display:</span> <span class="string">block;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>3.在你的主题配置文件里面配置这个</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">font-family:</span> <span class="string">kai</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>就ok了</p><p>还有，记得引入cunstom.cs</p>]]></content>
      
      
