      <title>数据结构·顺序表</title>
      <link href="/2025/10/31/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%C2%B7%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E8%A1%A8/"/>
      <url>/2025/10/31/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%C2%B7%E9%A1%BA%E5%BA%8F%E8%A1%A8/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="😂C语言基本架构"><a href="#😂C语言基本架构" class="headerlink" title="😂C语言基本架构"></a>😂C语言基本架构</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;   <span class="comment">//主函数main</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;  <span class="comment">//;一定不要忘了！！！</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>ok那么好，了解完这些后我们来学习线性表</p><h3 id="😀顺序表的逻辑定义"><a href="#😀顺序表的逻辑定义" class="headerlink" title="😀顺序表的逻辑定义"></a>😀顺序表的逻辑定义</h3><p>线性表是由 n (n&gt;&#x3D;0)个数据元素(节点)a1,a2,a3…an组成的有限序列。</p><p>只有开始节点a1没有直接前趋，只有一个直接后继a2。       只有一个终结节点an没有直接后继，只有一个直接前趋an-1</p><p>其余的内部节点都有且仅有一个直接前趋和一个直接后继。</p><h3 id="😀顺序表的基本运算"><a href="#😀顺序表的基本运算" class="headerlink" title="😀顺序表的基本运算"></a>😀顺序表的基本运算</h3><p>InitList( L ):构造一个空的线性表L，即表的初始化。</p><p>ListLength( L ):求线性表L中的结点个数，即求表长。</p><p>GetNode( L , i ):取线性表中第i个结点。</p><p>LocateNode( L , x )在L表中查找值为x的结点，并返回x在L中的位置，如果L中没有节点的值为x,那么就返回一个特殊值表示查找失败。</p><p>InsertList( L , x , i  ):在表L中的第i个位置插入一个值为x的结点</p><p>DeleteList( L , i ):删除线性表L的第i个结点。</p><h3 id="案例-顺序表"><a href="#案例-顺序表" class="headerlink" title="案例-顺序表"></a>案例-顺序表</h3><h4 id="宏定义"><a href="#宏定义" class="headerlink" title="宏定义"></a>宏定义</h4><p>先宏定义一个值来限定顺序表的最大长度</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> ListSize 10 <span class="comment">//宏定义</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="结构体的定义"><a href="#结构体的定义" class="headerlink" title="结构体的定义"></a>结构体的定义</h4><p>定义顺序表的结构体，包含数组和记录长度的变量</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> data[ListSize];</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> length;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;SeqList;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="函数的调用和实现"><a href="#函数的调用和实现" class="headerlink" title="函数的调用和实现"></a>函数的调用和实现</h4><h5 id="1-printList打印顺序表"><a href="#1-printList打印顺序表" class="headerlink" title="1.printList打印顺序表"></a>1.printList打印顺序表</h5><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">printList</span><span class="params">(SeqList L)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;顺序表表长:%d\n&quot;</span>,L.length);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; L.length; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>,L.data[i]);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>代码解释：先定义了一个无返回值的函数<code>printLis</code>，参数是<code>SeqList L</code>（顺序表结构体）</p><p>for循环这里着重讲一下，for循环的作用是循环遍历顺序表中的所有元素，从索引0开始到<code>L.length-1</code></p><p><code>L.data[ i ]</code>是访问顺序表的第 i+1 个位置的元素</p><h5 id="2-initList初始化顺序表"><a href="#2-initList初始化顺序表" class="headerlink" title="2.initList初始化顺序表"></a>2.initList初始化顺序表</h5><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">initList</span><span class="params">(SeqList* L)</span>&#123;  <span class="comment">//指针接收地址</span></span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>代码解释：先定义了一个无返回值的函数<code> initList</code>，参数是<code>SeqList* L</code>，<strong>指向</strong>顺序表结构体的指针（指针用于接受地址参数）</p><p><code>L-&gt;length = 0</code>;是先将顺序表的长度成员设置为0；-&gt;是指针访问结构体成员的运算符</p><h5 id="🤔何时使用指针？值or指？"><a href="#🤔何时使用指针？值or指？" class="headerlink" title="🤔何时使用指针？值or指？"></a>🤔何时使用指针？值or指？</h5><p>当<strong>只需要读取数据</strong>但是不需要修改时用值，如果需要修改原数据时用指针</p><p>值传递（不修改）</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">modifyValue</span><span class="params">(SeqList L)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    L.length = <span class="number">100</span>;  <span class="comment">// 只修改副本，原数据不变</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    SeqList <span class="built_in">list</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">list</span>.length = <span class="number">5</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    modifyValue(<span class="built_in">list</span>);    <span class="comment">// 传递值</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, <span class="built_in">list</span>.length);  <span class="comment">// 输出5，未被修改</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>指针传递（修改源数据）</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">modifyPointer</span><span class="params">(SeqList* L)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length = <span class="number">100</span>;  <span class="comment">// 修改原数据</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    SeqList <span class="built_in">list</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">list</span>.length = <span class="number">5</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    modifyPointer(&amp;<span class="built_in">list</span>); <span class="comment">// 传递地址</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>, <span class="built_in">list</span>.length);  <span class="comment">// 输出100，已被修改</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="3-locateList查找元素位置"><a href="#3-locateList查找元素位置" class="headerlink" title="3.locateList查找元素位置"></a>3.locateList查找元素位置</h5><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">locateList</span><span class="params">(SeqList L ,<span class="type">int</span> val)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>;i &lt; L.length;i++)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(L.data[i] == val)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> i;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>代码解释:int 表示找到返回索引，未找到返回 -1。<code>SeqList L</code>表示顺序表(值传递)，<code>int val</code>表示要查找的目标。</p><p>for循环作用为遍历顺序表中的所有元素，从索引0开始，到<code>L.length-1</code>结束。</p><p>第三行的if判断是判断当前元素是否等于目标值，如果相等返回 i ，循环结束后如果没有找到目标值，返回 -1 表示查找失败。</p><h6 id="😉地址计算公式："><a href="#😉地址计算公式：" class="headerlink" title="😉地址计算公式："></a>😉地址计算公式：</h6><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">loc(aj) = (j - i) × L + loc(ai)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//loc(ai)：已知元素 ai 的地址</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//loc(aj)：要计算的元素 aj 的地址</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//i, j：元素的位置索引</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//L：每个元素占用的字节数（元素长度）</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//j - i：两个元素之间的位置差</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="4-insertList插入元素"><a href="#4-insertList插入元素" class="headerlink" title="4.insertList插入元素"></a>4.insertList插入元素</h5><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">insertList</span><span class="params">(SeqList *L,<span class="type">int</span> index,<span class="type">int</span> val)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(index &lt; <span class="number">1</span> || index &gt; L-&gt;length + <span class="number">1</span> || index &gt; ListSize)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> j = L-&gt;length - <span class="number">1</span>; j &gt; index - <span class="number">1</span>; j--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        L-&gt;data[j+<span class="number">1</span>] = L-&gt;data[j];</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;data[index - <span class="number">1</span>] = val;</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length++;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> index <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>代码解释：<code>SeqList *L</code>使用指针传递，因为要修改数据表中的内容。</p><p>if判断是对插入位置的合法性检查，分别为：位置不能小于1，不能跳过空位插入，不能超过最大容量。</p><p>for循环：<strong>移动元素（从后往前移动）</strong>，j从最后一个元素开始，移动到<code>j &gt; index-1</code>（插入位置的前一个）,每个元素向后移动一位，为插入腾出空间。</p><p><code> L-&gt;data[index - 1] = val;</code>是在腾出来的位置插入新的值。</p><p>一切结束之后要记得更新表长<code>length</code></p><h6 id="😉其他小知识点"><a href="#😉其他小知识点" class="headerlink" title="😉其他小知识点"></a>😉其他小知识点</h6><p>1.<strong>顺序表的插入时间复杂度为O(n)</strong></p><p>2.在一个长度为n的顺序表中的第 i 个元素(1&lt;&#x3D;i&lt;&#x3D;n+1)之前插入一个元素时，需向后移动 <strong>n - i + 1</strong>个元素</p><p>3.在表长为n的顺序表上做插入运算，平均要移动的结点数为 n&#x2F;2</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">平均移动结点数 = 所有可能情况的移动次数总和 ÷ 情况总数，</span><br><span class="line">可以插入的位置有n + <span class="number">1</span>个，</span><br><span class="line">移动次数之和为n + (n<span class="number">-1</span>) + (n<span class="number">-2</span>) + ... + <span class="number">1</span> + <span class="number">0</span>=n(n+<span class="number">1</span>)/<span class="number">2</span>，</span><br><span class="line">[n(n+<span class="number">1</span>)/<span class="number">2</span>] ÷ (n+<span class="number">1</span>) = n/<span class="number">2</span>，</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h5 id="5-deleteList删除元素"><a href="#5-deleteList删除元素" class="headerlink" title="5.deleteList删除元素"></a>5.deleteList删除元素</h5><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">deleteList</span><span class="params">(SeqList *L,<span class="type">int</span> index)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(index&lt;<span class="number">1</span>||index&gt;L-&gt;length)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//后继的位置向前移动，从插入的位置到表的最后</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i = index;i&lt;L-&gt;length;i++)</span><br><span class="line">        L-&gt;data[i<span class="number">-1</span>] = L-&gt;data[i];</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length --;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> L-&gt;data[index<span class="number">-1</span>];</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>代码解释：<code>SeqList *L</code>是指针传递，因为要修改顺序表。<code>index</code>表示的是删除的位置</p><p>if判断：删除位置的合法性检查，分别是位置不能小于 1 ，不能删除不存在的元素。</p><p>for循环:<strong>移动元素（从前往后移动）</strong>，i 从删除位置开始(<code>index</code>)，移动到<code>i &lt; L-&gt;length</code>，每个后续元素向前移动一位，覆盖被删除的元素</p><p>最后记得更新表长<code>length</code></p><h6 id="😉其他小知识点-1"><a href="#😉其他小知识点-1" class="headerlink" title="😉其他小知识点"></a>😉其他小知识点</h6><p>1.删除第 i 个元素需要移动 <strong>n - i</strong>个元素</p><p>2.顺序表的删除时间复杂度为O(n)</p><p>3.在表长为n的顺序表上做删除运算，平均要移动的结点数为 n-1&#x2F;2</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">平均移动结点数 = 所有可能情况的移动次数总和 ÷ 情况总数，</span><br><span class="line">可以插入的位置有n个，</span><br><span class="line">移动次数之和为(n<span class="number">-1</span>) + (n<span class="number">-2</span>) + ... + <span class="number">1</span> + <span class="number">0</span>=n(n<span class="number">-1</span>)/<span class="number">2</span>，</span><br><span class="line">[n(n<span class="number">-1</span>)/<span class="number">2</span>] ÷ n = (n<span class="number">-1</span>)/<span class="number">2</span>，</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="最终的代码奉上"><a href="#最终的代码奉上" class="headerlink" title="最终的代码奉上"></a>最终的代码奉上</h3><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> ListSize 10 <span class="comment">//宏定义</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> data[ListSize];<span class="comment">//顺序表的数据</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> length; <span class="comment">//顺序表的长度</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;SeqList;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">printList</span><span class="params">(SeqList L)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;顺序表表长:%d\n&quot;</span>,L.length);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; L.length; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d&quot;</span>,L.data[i]);</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">insertList</span><span class="params">(SeqList *L,<span class="type">int</span> index,<span class="type">int</span> val)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(index&lt;<span class="number">1</span>||index&gt;L-&gt;length+<span class="number">1</span>||index&gt;ListSize)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> j = L-&gt;length<span class="number">-1</span>; j &gt; index<span class="number">-1</span>; j--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        L-&gt;data[j+<span class="number">1</span>] = L-&gt;data[j];</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;data[index - <span class="number">1</span>] = val;</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length++;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> index <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">initList</span><span class="params">(SeqList* L)</span>&#123;  <span class="comment">//指针接收地址</span></span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">locateList</span><span class="params">(SeqList L ,<span class="type">int</span> val)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>;i &lt; L.length;i++)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(L.data[i] == val)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> i;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">deleteList</span><span class="params">(SeqList *L,<span class="type">int</span> index)</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span>(index&lt;<span class="number">1</span>||index&gt;L-&gt;length)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">-1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//后继的位置向前移动，从插入的位置到表的最后</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i = index;i&lt;L-&gt;length;i++)</span><br><span class="line">        L-&gt;data[i<span class="number">-1</span>] = L-&gt;data[i];</span><br><span class="line">    L-&gt;length --;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> L-&gt;data[index<span class="number">-1</span>];</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">()</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    SeqList L;  <span class="comment">//声明一个SeqList数据容器</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//顺序表的初始化</span></span><br><span class="line">    initList(&amp;L);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//顺序表的插入</span></span><br><span class="line">    insertList(&amp;L,<span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">1</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    insertList(&amp;L,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    insertList(&amp;L,<span class="number">3</span>,<span class="number">3</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//顺序表的打印</span></span><br><span class="line">    printList(L);<span class="comment">//传入值   对数据修改用&#x27;&amp;&#x27; 传是指针</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    deleteList(&amp;L,<span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    printList(L);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//获取元素的指定下标</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>,locateList(L,<span class="number">1</span>));</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="能够耐心看到这里已经打败-99-的人了-🤣"><a href="#能够耐心看到这里已经打败-99-的人了-🤣" class="headerlink" title="能够耐心看到这里已经打败 99% 的人了!!!🤣"></a>能够耐心看到这里已经打败 99% 的人了!!!🤣</h4>]]></content>
      
      
